</style><div class="ev-shell"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><a href="/maps">Maps</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Early vote</span></nav><header class="ph ev-ph"><div class="eye g">Nationwide early vote</div><h1>2026 early vote <em>tracker</em></h1><div class="pmeta"><span>General election <b>November 3, 2026</b></span><span>Modeled by <b>On Point Polling</b> where states report no party or demographics</span><span>Click a state for its counties</span></div></header><p class="evs-lede">As of <b>October 21, 2026</b>, <b>15,269,880</b> ballots have been cast in the 2026 midterm elections across<!-- --> <b>43<!-- --> reporting states</b>: <!-- -->9.6 million<!-- --> mail ballots returned and <!-- -->5.7 million<!-- --> cast in person. In the states that report party, <!-- -->registered Democrats have cast 46.3% of these ballots, Republicans 29.6% and independents and third parties 24.1%<!-- -->. This early vote tracker updates every day with each state&#x27;s count, its pace against 2022 and 2024, and what the ballots so far mean for the <a href="/forecast">On Point forecast</a>.</p><div class="db-kpis" role="tablist" aria-label="Ballots"><button role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="db-kpi on"><span class="txt"><b>0</b><em>Total ballots cast</em><small>mail returned plus in person</small></span><svg width="46" height="46" viewBox="0 0 46 46" class="db-ring" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="23" cy="23" r="18" class="trk"></circle><circle cx="23" cy="23" r="18" class="val" stroke="#9b8cff" stroke-dasharray="0 113.09733552923255" transform="rotate(-90 23 23)"></circle><text x="50%" y="50%" dy="0.35em" text-anchor="middle">0.0<!-- -->%</text></svg></button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="db-kpi"><span class="txt"><b>0</b><em>Early in person</em><small>cast before Election Day</small></span><svg width="46" height="46" viewBox="0 0 46 46" class="db-ring" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="23" cy="23" r