\",\"temporalCoverage\":\"2026-09-01/2026-10-21\",\"spatialCoverage\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"United States\"},\"keywords\":[\"early vote tracker\",\"2026 early vote tracker\",\"early voting 2026\",\"early vote numbers\",\"how many people have voted early\",\"mail ballots returned\",\"early voting by party\",\"midterm early vote\",\"early vote by state\",\"early vote by county\"],\"variableMeasured\":[\"Mail ballots requested\",\"Mail ballots returned\",\"In person early votes\",\"Early votes by party registration\"],\"measurementTechnique\":\"Official state and county early vote counts, with party estimated by On Point Polling where a state reports none\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://onpointpolitics.us/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Maps\",\"item\":\"https://onpointpolitics.us/maps\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Early vote tracker\",\"item\":\"https://onpointpolitics.us/maps/early-vote\"}]},{\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How many people have voted early in the 2026 midterms?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"As of October 21, 2026, 15,269,880 ballots have been cast across 43 reporting states: 9,585,204 mail ballots returned and 5,684,676 cast in person. Another 38,099,638 mail ballots sent or requested have not been returned yet.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which states report early votes by party?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"24 states report the party registration of early voters: Florida, North Carolina, Pennsylvania, Arizona, Colorado, New Jersey, Maryland, Nevada, New Mexico, Oregon, Maine, Iowa, Arkansas, Nebraska, Utah, Kansas, Rhode Island, South Dakota, Idaho, Wyoming, Connecticut, Kentucky, Oklahoma, Delaware. In those states registered Democrats have cast 46.3% of these ballots, Republicans 29.6% and independents and third parties 24.1%. Party registration shows who has voted, not how they voted. For states that report no party, On Point Polling estimates the party mix from county results and voter demographics.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When is Election Day 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Election Day is Tuesday, November 3, 2026, 13 days after the latest count. Early voting dates, mail ballot deadlines and in person hours are set by each state.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where do these early vote numbers come from?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Counts come from state and county election offices, compiled by civicAPI and refreshed every day. On Point Politics adds the party and demographic estimates, the comparison with 2022 and 2024 and the check against the On Point forecast.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does the early vote tell us who will win?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Not by itself. Early voters lean older and more partisan than Election Day voters, and the mix changes as more ballots come in. The tracker compares each state with its own pace in 2022 and 2024 and with the On Point forecast, which is the better test of whether a state is running ahead of or behind expectations.\"}}]},{\"@type\":\"ItemList\",\"name\":\"Early vote by state\",\"numberOfItems\":43,\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"California early vote tracker\",\"url\":\"https://onpointpolitics.us/maps/early-vote/california\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Florida early vote tracker\",\"url\":\"https://onpointpolitics.us/maps/early-vote/florida\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Georgia early vote tracker\",\"url\":\"https://onpointpolitics.us/maps/early-vote/georgia\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"North Carolina early vote tracker\",\"url\":\"https://onpointpolitics.us/maps/early-vote/north-c